      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now I understand the test. The key improvements needed are:\n1. Remove all unused data provider methods (only `data_lengthOfMonth` is needed)\n2. Remove all unused imports\n3. Format the data provider entries one-per-line for readability\n4. Clarify the unused `day` parameter (data provides it but test uses `1`)Now I'll run the compile check.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version removes all unused data provider methods and imports, reformats the `data_lengthOfMonth` entries one-per-line with explanatory comments, and renames the unused `day` parameter to `dayUnused` to make its intent clear."
